Maps
----
suwalki.tres – Suwalki Lakeland around Szurpily (Suwalki Landscape Park, Poland), 30x24 hexes
of 250 m, UTM 34N. Real data, downloaded 2026-10-31:
  DEM tile Copernicus_DSM_COG_10_N54_00_E022_00_DEM
  OSM extract (Overpass, bbox 54.20580,22.81264,54.26417,22.94746)
  Rebuild: tools/import_map.py --center=54.235,22.88 --size=30x24 --hex=250 --name=suwalki
           --display-name="Suwalki Lakeland (Szurpily)" --out=data/maps/suwalki.tres
  (a re-download gets today's OpenStreetMap, so the result may differ from the committed file)

The test map tests/fixtures/maps/sample_map.tres is built from SYNTHETIC fixtures
(tools/import_map_fixtures/, see tools/test_import_map.py) – no real data.
